\viewkind4\uc1\pard\fi-225\li225\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\ulnone\b0 
\par 1.\cf0  Draw near to the Lord's Table
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0 God has welcome you all
\par Come with faith and do repent
\par for the grace of the Lord
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par Pray to Him, come proclaim
\par Christ Jesus' death to all
\par and again His great Love
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li225\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2.  When you eat the bread of life
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0 And you drink His own blood,
\par He will  give to you His life,
\par thus for everlasting.
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par Jesus died to save you
\par in your troubles and sins;
\par and arose with you all.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li360\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 3.  Come with cheers and all your praise
\par \pard\li360\sl190\slmult0 give thanks to your Master!
\par Come and follow Jesus Christ
\par bear good witness to Him
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par Christ arose, His glory
\par Shall be blessings to all
\par And makes change in your life.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li360\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 4\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 4.  Jesus, perfect man of all
\par \pard\li360\sl190\slmult0 Saviour of the poor ones
\par Look, I open all my heart
\par Come in as you like it
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par You alone, that I love
\par You will be my refuge
\par \pard      and will make me happy.\f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b\f2\fs14 
\par }

